card.text:
Surveil 2.
Exile a card from your hand and the top two cards of your library. You may play the exiled cards until the end of your next turn.
Flashback {4}{R}{R}

You may have Fangtastic Fashion enter as the color of your choice.
Vivid — Equipped creature gets +X/+X and has menace and ward {X}, where X is the number of colors among permanents you control.
Equip {5}
